{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Coromon: Rogue Planet",
    "steam_appid": 3195360,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coromon: Rogue Planet combines the rich strategy of tactical turn-based combat from Coromon with strategic rogue-like gameplay to create an endlessly-replayable monster taming gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195360/extras/5b28f63c95494621d5aadbf003541975.poster.avif?t=1747712771\" width=616 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195360/extras/5b28f63c95494621d5aadbf003541975.webm?t=1747712771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a variety of over 15 ever-changing biomes! Make tactical decisions on which paths to take as you navigate across the planet of Velua, weighing risk and reward. Each biome contains its own story, new and interesting challenges, as well as its own biosphere of Coromon. Procedurally-generated maps, encounters, and rewards ensure that every run progresses the story while feeling fresh and new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195360/extras/4b4de0ae68ee9f74da978e0e4272a32f.poster.avif?t=1747712771\" width=616 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195360/extras/4b4de0ae68ee9f74da978e0e4272a32f.webm?t=1747712771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock 7 different playable characters, each with their own starter, story, and playstyle! As you navigate your way through Velua\u2019s diverse wildlands, you\u2019ll find other trainers in need of your help. Join forces with them to permanently unlock them as a playable character, mastering each character\u2019s unique playstyle and mechanics as you battle alongside a team of Coromon. As you complete milestone goals, you\u2019ll discover their stories and gain new bonuses for every successive run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195360/extras/2a1a46389ef9676dfc57243702d1167b.poster.avif?t=1747712771\" width=616 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195360/extras/2a1a46389ef9676dfc57243702d1167b.webm?t=1747712771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one of 7 brand-new starter Coromon, then battle, catch, and tame over 130 monsters! Each Coromon has a unique blend of elemental affinities, personality traits, and skills. Work together with your team of Coromon to improve their skills, tailor their moveset, and grow their power, then battle against wild Coromon, trainers, hordes, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195360/extras/87e52ac44e2472af556604889df4e58c.poster.avif?t=1747712771\" width=616 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195360/extras/87e52ac44e2472af556604889df4e58c.webm?t=1747712771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover more about the strange origins of the Crimsonite plague threatening Velua! On your travels, you\u2019ll encounter creatures infected by Crimsonite\u2014a dangerous, volatile substance which spreads to anything it touches, consuming elemental energy. Your Coromon can contract the infection, leading to thrilling, high-risk, high-reward gameplay, making them more resilient... but not without risk. As the infection increases in strength, your Coromon will grow more and more disobedient. If left untreated, they\u2019ll become uncontrollable and flee. So be careful out there!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195360/extras/7e8f15ee4884325ba4f97fb886bb00c3.poster.avif?t=1747712771\" width=616 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195360/extras/7e8f15ee4884325ba4f97fb886bb00c3.webm?t=1747712771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a variety of gadgets to customize your capabilities! A meta-progression system allows you to consistently improve your skills and abilities, becoming increasingly powerful over time. Allocate and use accrued resources to improve your hub area and unlock new skills and abilities. You\u2019ll need a combination of luck and skill to survive the Veluan wilderness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195360/extras/01fd11018770ee24be71c43695566fd9.poster.avif?t=1747712771\" width=616 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195360/extras/01fd11018770ee24be71c43695566fd9.webm?t=1747712771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect resources to further Lux Solis\u2019 journey to the stars! On your travels, you\u2019ll encounter the mysterious remains of an interstellar spaceship. Each time you bring back new information and resources from these encounters, not only will Lux Solis reward you with additional funding, but you\u2019ll be working together with every other player to progress a global narrative and unlock the secrets of the galaxy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*Artwork shown not final</i></p>",
